---
import MarketingLayout from '../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
import { withBasePath } from '../utils/helpers';
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Olive Global Systems"
  description="Terms governing access to this website and engagement communications with Olive Global Systems."
  bodyClass="bg-[#06101d]"
  showStickyCTA={false}
  showLiveChat={false}
  mainClass="relative isolate overflow-x-clip"
  showSavedRoutesDock={false}
>
  <section
    class="border-b border-white/10"
    data-reveal
    id="terms-hero"
    data-page-section
  >
    <div
      class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-4 pb-14 pt-20 sm:px-6 sm:pb-20 sm:pt-28"
    >
      <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:items-end">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <p
            class="font-mono text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-white/55"
          >
            Legal
          </p>
          <h1
            class="max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
          >
            Terms of Service
          </h1>
          <p class="max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
            These terms explain how this website should be used and clarify that
            service work only begins through a separate signed agreement.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/55">Last updated: February 15, 2026</p>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a
              href={withBasePath('contact-hq/')}
              class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-slate-100"
            >
              Contact HQ
            </a>
            <a
              href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}
              class="inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-white/20 hover:bg-white/[0.08]"
            >
              Email terms questions
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6">
            <p
              class="font-mono text-[0.66rem] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/45"
            >
              In short
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
              The site is informational. It helps explain services and route new
              conversations, but it does not create a contract by itself.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-6">
            <p
              class="font-mono text-[0.66rem] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white/45"
            >
              Main boundary
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-300">
              Scope, pricing, delivery obligations, and legal commitments are
              only defined in formal signed agreements.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    class="py-16 sm:py-20"
    data-reveal
    id="terms-details"
    data-page-section
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-[960px] px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid gap-6">
        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">1. Acceptance</h2>
          <p>
            By using this website, you agree to these terms. If you do not
            agree, please discontinue use of the site.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
            2. Informational use
          </h2>
          <p>
            Site content is provided for general information about services,
            capabilities, and project intake pathways. Content may be updated
            without prior notice.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">3. Engagement scope</h2>
          <p>
            Nothing on this site creates a service contract by itself. Formal
            scope, pricing, and delivery terms are defined only in signed
            agreements.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">4. Acceptable use</h2>
          <p>
            You agree not to misuse, disrupt, probe, or attempt unauthorized
            access to this site, related infrastructure, or connected services.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
            5. Third-party services
          </h2>
          <p>
            External links and third-party platforms are provided for
            convenience. We are not responsible for their content, availability,
            or policies.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
            6. Warranty disclaimer
          </h2>
          <p>
            This site is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis,
            without warranties of any kind, express or implied.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
            7. Limitation of liability
          </h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by law, Olive Global Systems is not
            liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising
            from site use.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-7">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">8. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions regarding these terms can be sent to
            <a
              href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}
              class="text-[#d7f75b] hover:text-white hover:underline"
            >
              {CONTACT_EMAIL}
            </a>.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
